      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found the best way to force this to happen is via launch arguments.  Specifically, I use:\n\n-force-vulkan\n\n-force-gfx-direct\n\n-force-vulkan-layers\n\nI run via alcom, I just add these to the editor commandline therein.",
